## Display — Phase 3. Both modes run in Plasma's compositor, KWin (below, with
## Plasma); Game Mode is the launcher open over the desktop. Hyprland used to be
## Game Mode's compositor and is gone: one compositor means switching modes is
## opening a window rather than restarting the display, and one thing to keep
## working across sleep.
xorg-xwayland
qt6-wayland
# libseat, which the sign-in screen's kiosk compositor (cage) is built against.
seatd
polkit

## Core gaming services — Phase 4
